{"_id":"23f5c051bc7d3dff","name":"Was-sceptre","type":"weapon","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/generic/auto-attack.webp","system":{"category":"Staves","description":"Also known as the sceptre of domination, this legendary artifact holds a terrible power over all forces of chaos and darkness. When you cast a non-white magick spell that deals damage, its damage is treated as dark against any target either immune, resistant, or weak to dark damage. Additionally, targets suffer a -2 to their Fort Defence against your black spells. Good creatures may not utilize the Was-Sceptre’s special qualities.","cost":40900,"availability":"Legendary","bulk":1,"weaponGroup":"staves","weaponSize":"Medium","weaponSkill":"spellcraft","attack":{"bonus":5},"damage":{"formula":"3d6+5","type":"Dark"},"range":"Ranged","capacity":0,"specialRules":"Also known as the sceptre of domination, this legendary artifact holds a terrible power over all forces of chaos and darkness. When you cast a non-white magick spell that deals damage, its damage is treated as dark against any target either immune, resistant, or weak to dark damage. Additionally, targets suffer a -2 to their Fort Defence against your black spells. Good creatures may not utilize the Was-Sceptre’s special qualities."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
